# #144 special cues: every Lich King special form shows its Warcraft spell (the Lich King has no #148 passive).
# Lich King a against Lich King b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero lich king
# #144: Defile.
40 a stick 0 -1
40 a tap X 2
41 a stick 0 0
42 a capture
60 a capture
# #144: Val'kyr Shadowguard.
120 a stick 1 0
120 a tap X 2
121 a stick 0 0
122 a capture
134 a capture
# #144: Howling Blast, then from the air.
200 a tap X 2
202 a capture
216 a capture
280 a tap B 8
290 a tap X 2
292 a capture
306 a capture
# #144: Val'kyr Shadowguard from the air, back toward the middle.
360 a tap B 8
370 a stick -1 0
370 a tap X 2
371 a stick 0 0
372 a capture
384 a capture
# #144: Ascension of the Damned, free: prior casts leave 13 mana, below its 15 cost.
430 a stick 0 1
430 a tap X 2
431 a stick 0 0
432 a capture
438 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
# #144: Ascension of the Damned from the air (it has no air form).
640 a tap B 8
650 a stick 0 1
650 a tap X 2
651 a stick 0 0
652 a capture
658 a capture
# #144: Ascension of the Damned, free (the mana is spent).
800 a stick 0 1
800 a tap X 2
801 a stick 0 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): every special form starts on its frame.
#! expect a 40 special 16 form 0
#! expect a 120 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 200 special 13 form 0
#! expect a 290 special 13 form 1
#! expect a 370 special 14 form 1
#! expect a 430 special 15 form 2
#! expect a 650 special 15 form 0
#! expect a 800 special 15 form 2
#! scene a DarkRitualCaster
#! scene a FreezingBreathMissile
#! scene a CurseTarget
#! scene a FrostNovaTarget
#! scene a DeathAndDecayTarget
#! scene a FrostWyrmMissile
#! scene a Banshee
#! scene a DarkPortalTarget
802 a capture
808 a capture
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
